{
  "id": "math5-c2-s3-n55",
  "card_id": "math5-c2-s3-n55",
  "chapter": "第二章　有理数",
  "section": "§7. 加法和减法",
  "number": "55",
  "title": "最小公倍数",
  "printed_title": "55. 最小公倍数",
  "start_page": 248,
  "start_printed": 239,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 8,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设$A$为4的倍数的自然数集合，$B$为6的倍数的自然数集合：\n$A=\\{4,8,12,16,20,24,28,32,36\\ldots\\}$；\n$B=\\{6,12,18,24,30,36\\ldots\\}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 239,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0248#8",
        "p0249#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "设$A$为4的倍数的自然数集合，$B$为6的倍数的自然数集合：$A=\\{4,8,12,16,20,24,28,32,36\\ldots\\}$；$B=\\{6,12,18,24,30,36\\ldots\\}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求$A$、$B$的交集：\n$A\\cap B=\\{12,24,36\\ldots\\}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "求$A$、$B$的交集：$A\\cap B=\\{12,24,36\\ldots\\}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个交集是由4和6的倍数构成. 这些数叫做4和6的公倍数. 其中最小的数是12，叫做4和6的最小公倍数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "这个交集是由4和6的倍数构成. 这些数叫做4和6的公倍数. 其中最小的数是12，叫做4和6的最小公倍数.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果把给出的数分解质因数，就能很容易地求出最小公倍数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果把给出的数分解质因数，就能很容易地求出最小公倍数.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1. 求360和378的最小公倍数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "例1. 求360和378的最小公倍数.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把360和378都分解质因数：\n$360=2^3\\cdot3^2\\cdot5$；\n$378=2\\cdot3^3\\cdot7$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "把360和378都分解质因数：$360=2^3\\cdot3^2\\cdot5$；$378=2\\cdot3^3\\cdot7$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "360和378中任何一数的全部质因数都应该包括在360和378最小公倍数的质因数里. 如果某一质因数包括在两个数的质因数里，就应该取指数较大的一个. 所以在360和378的最小公倍数的质因数里就包括因数$2^3$、$3^3$、5和7. 也就是最小公倍数等于$2^3\\cdot3^3\\cdot5\\cdot7=7560$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "360和378中任何一数的全部质因数都应该包括在360和378最小公倍数的质因数里. 如果某一质因数包括在两个数的质因数里，就应该取指数较大的一个. 所以在360和378的最小公倍数的质因数里就包括因数$2^3$、$3^3$、5和7. 也就是最小公倍数等于$2^3\\cdot3^3\\cdot5\\cdot7=7560$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用同样方法可以求出3个以上的数的最小公倍数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "用同样方法可以求出3个以上的数的最小公倍数.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. 求72，120，180的最小公倍数.$72=2^3\\cdot3^2$；\n$120=2^3\\cdot3\\cdot5$，\n$180=2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5$.所以，72，120和180的最小公倍数等于$2^3\\cdot3^2\\cdot5=360$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 240,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0249#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "例2. 求72，120，180的最小公倍数.$72=2^3\\cdot3^2$；$120=2^3\\cdot3\\cdot5$，$180=2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot5$.所以，72，120和180的最小公倍数等于$2^3\\cdot3^2\\cdot5=360$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
